\":1},{\"id\":217568,\"title\":\"Bros On Foot\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/98ktxSmEUWjQKEdIV5hdDEjrkqf.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2111111111111111,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":315551,\"title\":\"Roadtrip Australia – Three Top Chefs on Four Wheels\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rPoNNDKhvcoWVEyk3stx6TzV09x.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.20967741935483872,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":70662,\"title\":\"Road 66\",\"poster\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.20849056603773586,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":65032,\"title\":\"Jon Richardson Grows Up\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8lKim1fY2IRQM0ILpMyyE8GSMLK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.20689655172413796,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"Season 5\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AcZTjWs5ajlLaHjsahSKP6R3JdP.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2013-12-03\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"A Whole Bunch of Cluck-Ups\",\"overview\":\"Jarrett's brush with Rock n' Roll fame takes a turn for the worse when he scrambles to deliver their chicken car on time. Meanwhile, Roy runs into trouble when he discovers a shipment is too rotted to load properly ...and that's when things really start to fall apart.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rEy2iS2HRwfoDojsXxVDWWJ5N76.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-03\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Guys and Dolls\",\"overview\":\"After challenging Chris that girls can do anything a guy can, Robbie takes over a very macho shipment--and Chris worries their profits might go down for the count. Jennifer moves a load of pricey mannequins through the heartland, and picks up an interesting travelling companion along way.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zqPLq5ghrvgH1fD5WNpe9Zpjcrr.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-03\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Buggin' Out\",\"overview\":\"Jennifer takes on a cross-country load of live bugs that require a little more love and attention than she might be willing to give. Marc takes on his daughter as an apprentice, and the two work through their issues as they move a number of Volkswagen buses.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9Sgx2yPgBJ5xZHRMuhHfREEAbyK.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-10\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Flight of the Giant Baby Head\",\"overview\":\"Fate brings Roy back to Austin, Texas--this time to haul a very big (and very odd) sculpture from a peace-loving art collective. Up north, Jarrett brings along his uncle to help move a flight simulator. But will a side load and extra family baggage prove to be more than he bargained for?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yHpvZl7BNV5WmGLeQ3hwledlemM.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-10\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"We Come in Pieces!\",\"overview\":\"Chris and Robbie awkwardly go where no transporter has gone before when a run brings them in contact with a Star Trek convention and its alien life forms. Meanwhile, Jarrett tries to glean from the past, and what he's learned from the other transporters as he tackles a load of massive pumpkins.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rKQCCAamxAWhu9RytHVN6Zqai22.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-17\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Chivalry's Dead... Roy Killed It\",\"overview\":\"Sparks fly when Roy battles with two customers while transporting their shipments to a Renaissance Faire... and everyone holds their breath as Jenn's entrusted to ship the future of bicycling.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qGzPstUBRXOuIaO79VpULsIIzR9.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-17\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"War of the Roses\",\"overview\":\"America's longest running music television show is in trouble when Roy wins the bid to move their iconic camera crane, and Marc's in hot water after picking up a hot tub, but it's at the drop off when things really bubble over.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3O3hM4dDs1OvNYl1lHpHypVJTcZ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-24\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Pop, the Tragic Dragon\",\"overview\":\"Things get blown out of proportion when Chris and Robbie face down a massive balloon dragon shipment, and Marc's in over-his-head when he agrees to haul a giant Whale sculpture made of trash.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ldcigwp1Y9s5OI1DmLB44G1Zejx.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-24\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Drilling & Probing\",\"overview\":\"Roy and his buddy Logan find themselves getting down and dirty as they tussle with a young oil baron and his derrick. Meanwhile Jarrett is more lost than ever when his run-in with a safe and its owner ends up out of this world.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1WhIeHimsQeNG9i8vfENdLioEaJ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-01-07\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"What NOT to Expect When You're Expecting Jarrett\",\"overview\":\"The customer finds it's \\\"Pack Your Own Load Day\\\" after Jenn is bested by the heat, fatigue, and big expectations--but that fares better than Jarrett where it's \\\"Kill Your Transporter Day\\\" after he almost crashes and burns a Vietnam era helicopter run.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oWK5VFkDFnkfU9emBoIBUV6hHqc.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-01-07\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Jack Pots & Cheap Shots\",\"overview\":\"Roy rolls the dice shipping the world's largest drum set, while Chris and Robbie land a less-than-noteworthy Mobile Tattoo Parlor. But the real gamble comes when Chris challenges Roy to a bet and they both go all in to see who the better transporter is.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6sUpoAkYuBaFadljhtRYUo6KnZW.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-01-14\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"It's My Party & I'll Shoot You If I Want To\",\"overview\":\"A little girl's birthday dream playhouse, turns into a nightmare when Marc discovers in route, that the house has a squatter. And Roy deals with more security than he bargained for after he lands a top secret government run.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aCEwEt9spA5R5YL23V6NbrnN1u1.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-01-14\",\"runtime\":24}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2012-01-10\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}